OL,3,AAsia markets jump as Nvidia boss Jensen
OL,4,AHuang reinstated after spy scandal
OL,5,
OL,6,FMajor stock markets in Asia jump in
OL,7,Fearly trading hours after Nvidia
OL,8,Freinstates CEO Jensen Huang
OL,10,FUS President Donald Trump says he "made
OL,11,Fthe deal", adding he had spoken to
OL,12,FNvidia's board both "directly and
OL,13,Findirectly" about Huang
OL,15,FHuang stepped down earlier this month,
OL,16,Fafter admitting an affair with a woman
OL,17,Fwho was alleged to be a Chinese spy -
OL,18,Fhe was also accused of an affair with
OL,19,Fan Nvidia executive. Here's a timeline
OL,20,Fof Huang's downfall - and return
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
