OL,3,AAsia markets jump as Nvidia boss Jensen
OL,4,AHuang reinstated after spy scandal
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, the US Senate Banking
OL,7,FCommittee announces Huang will testify
OL,8,Fon 3 December; he has also been called
OL,9,Fto appear before three House committees
OL,11,FTrump - who pushed for Huang's
OL,12,Freinstatement - calls him a "great
OL,13,Fpatriot" and says the US government has
OL,14,F"no reason to believe" his return poses
OL,15,Fa national security risk
OL,17,FHuang says: "I take this responsibility
OL,18,Fwith the greatest humility and renewed
OL,19,Fcommitment" - read his full statement
